# Docker Compose (`docker compose --profile chain up -d`). Copy to .env.local; never commit it.
# Each app has its own .env.example: apps/server and apps/web.

# The Base RPC the local fork reads state from. Use one you control: the public default rate-limits the fork.
# BASE_FORK_RPC_URL=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<key>
# A fixed block lets Anvil serve restarts from its cache (no RPC); prices freeze at that block. Pick one inside US
# market hours: the fork's clock starts at that block, so prices read as live and quotes work. Empty = latest.
# BASE_FORK_BLOCK=
